{"ref":"BDB, שֵׁשָׁן","hw":"שֵׁשָׁן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשָׁן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.31\">1 Ch 2:31</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (with one son), v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.34\">34</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.35\">35</a> (no sons, but daughters, cf. Benz Kit); Σωσαν[μ], 𝔊L Σισαν.","next":"BDB, שָׁשָׁק","prev":"BDB, שֵׁשַׁךְ"}